# miniandroid/ local .gitignore — S-SLIM consolidated (2026-11-23)
# The root .gitignore carries the global classes (builds, APKs, traces).
# Only runtime-tree specifics live here.

# runtime data root (fonts are the tracked exception)
runtime/data/*
!runtime/data/fonts/
!runtime/data/fonts/*

# run stores + probe outputs (external-artifact law, docs/ARTIFACT_LIFECYCLE.md)
run/
core
framework_res_tmp/

# downloaded/portable toolchains and caches (bootstrap recipes re-fetch them)
tools/dl/
tools/ccache-bin/
tools/ccache_dl/
tools/ccache_cache/

# harness make captures (raw stdout/stderr never tracked)
make_out*.txt
make_err*.txt
